# Standing and temporary exceptions to the information-discipline rules in
# scripts/check-public-readiness.mjs. One per line:
#   <rule-id> <path>[:<line>] <expires YYYY-MM-DD|never> <reason>
# An expired entry fails the check; so does an entry whose path is gone.
# Exceptions are for fixtures that must carry a forbidden shape, never for
# documents.
id.coordination-identifier fdpm-cli/scripts/rename_plugin.py:90 never the rename tool's skip list names the coordination directory so it is never rewritten
